From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: koalabuttz <27229333+koalabuttz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 08:52:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: bound the unsafe string calls in gfx_d3d, win32 and
 sound

strcpy, strcat, sprintf and unterminated _snprintf/_vsnprintf calls in
src/gfx_d3d, src/win32 and src/sound write without knowing how large
the destination is. Part 4 of 4 for upstream issue 8; src/radiant is
not covered.

The replacements are the engine's own bounded forms (I_strncpyz,
I_strncat, Com_sprintf, Com_sprintfPos) and C99 snprintf/vsnprintf,
each given the destination's size. No MSVC *_s functions, so the code
stays portable.
---
 src/gfx_d3d/r_cinematic.cpp         | 20 ++++++++++----------
 src/gfx_d3d/r_debug.cpp             |  3 +--
 src/gfx_d3d/r_material_load_obj.cpp | 12 ++++++++----
 src/gfx_d3d/r_material_override.cpp |  3 +--
 src/gfx_d3d/r_warn.cpp              |  2 +-
